Subject: [PATCH 539/652] riscv: dts: eswin: starpro64: tweak GMAC0 RX delay

Signed-off-by: Icenowy Zheng <uwu@icenowy.me>
---
 arch/riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7700-pine64-starpro64.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7700-pine64-starpro64.dts b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7700-pine64-starpro64.dts
index 4e440aa2f43e1..7f71dd33b71fd 100644
